<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/42/eng@/~cl_5__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) The master, owner, agent or charterer of a vessel, the captain of an aircraft or the driver of a train arriving in or leaving Malaysia shall report to an immigration officer the presence on board of any stowaway or any unauthorized person or any person proceeding to any state or country on the person’s removal from any other state or country by the competent authorities of that other state or country.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/42/eng@> .
