<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/42/eng@/~cl_5__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) The master, owner, agent or charterer of any vessel, the captain of any aircraft or the driver of any train who contravenes or fails to comply with subsection (1) or (2); or any person who hinders or obstructs any examination of a vessel, aircraft or train, shall be guilty of an offence against this Act.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/42/eng@> .
